  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 3.8.1: Schema RAG Refinements (PATCH Release - 2026-01-28)\n\nADDED:\n- Comprehensive CancellationToken propagation in schema-related services for better cancellation handling\n\nIMPROVEMENTS:\n- SQL Query Generation and Schema RAG: Removed unused SQL prompt and dialect helpers to simplify maintenance\n- Result Merger and query coordination: Simplified merging and removed dead code paths for cleaner flow\n- Storage Factory and QueryTokenizer: Reduced complexity and eliminated unused branches\n- Context Expansion and Qdrant search: Simplified logic and removed unused helpers while preserving behavior\n- Conversation and FileWatcher services: Removed unused events and helpers to reduce noise\n\nTECHNICAL DETAILS:\n- Maintained 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- No public API changes; all updates are internal refactorings and performance/maintainability improvements\n- Includes all features from 3.8.0 Schema RAG implementation (schema migration and chunking services)",
